(F5 T5 U10: group_beam_force_moment_plasti in 2D (the plastic beam uses
 the local-axes beam also in 2D). Same case and results as
 group_beam_force_moment_plasti1:
 ideally plastic hinges at the beam element ends, GNU model (not the
 Professional clipping: BEAM-PLASTIC-HINGE). Propped cantilever, length
 4, fixed at x 0, roller at x 4, point load P at x 2, E 1, Izz 1,
 plastic moment Mp 1 at every element end. Elastic: moment at the fixed
 end 3 P L / 16, so the first hinge forms at P = 16 Mp / (3 L) = 1.3333.
 Load P = 0.1 t up to P 1.4: the fixed end stays at Mp, the structure
 behaves as a simply supported beam with end moment Mp:
 moment under the load P L / 4 - Mp / 2 = 0.9 (below Mp, no collapse),
 deflection under the load P L^3 / (48 E I) - Mp L^2 / (16 E I) = 0.866667
 (elastic 7 P L^3 / (768 E I) = 0.816667),
 roller reaction P / 2 - Mp / L = 0.45 (elastic 5 P / 16 = 0.4375).
 Collapse load 6 Mp / L = 1.5 is not reached. The load is held for two
 more steps (the step where the hinge forms iterates with the elastic
 matrix of the new hinge).)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
beam_rotation
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 2 0
node 4 3 0
node 5 4 0
element 1 -beam 1 2
element 2 -beam 2 3
element 3 -beam 3 4
element 4 -beam 4 5
group_type 0 -beam
group_beam_young 0 1
group_beam_shear 0 1
group_beam_inertia 0 1 1 1
group_beam_memory 0 -total_linear
group_beam_force_moment_plasti 0  1e10 1e10 1e10 1e10 1e10 1  1e10 1e10 1e10 1e10 1e10 1
bounda_dof 0 1 -velx -vely -rotz
bounda_dof 1 -ra 2 5 -ra -velx
bounda_dof 2 5 -vely
bounda_force 3 3 -vely
bounda_time 3 0. 0. 14. -1.4 100. -1.4
control_timestep 10 1. 14.
control_timestep_iterations 10 20
control_timestep 20 1. 2.
control_timestep_iterations 20 20
target_item 0 -element_beam_force_moment 1 5
target_value 0 1. 1.e-8
target_item 1 -element_beam_force_moment 2 11
target_value 1 0.9 1.e-8
target_item 2 -node_dof 3 -disy
target_value 2 -0.8666666666667 1.e-8
target_item 3 -node_rhside 5 -vely
target_value 3 -0.45 1.e-8
end_data
